      "text": "quorum = floor(N/2) + 1.   4 managers tolerate no more failures\nthan 3,\nso use an ODD number: 3, 5 or 7.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "b26",
      "originalText": "quorum = floor(N/2) + 1.   4 managers tolerate no more failures than 3,\nso use an ODD number: 3, 5 or 7.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
